{
  "locale": "es",
  "scriptSource": "Spanish: OpenAI Whisper (base) on IA Viridiana.mp4; English glosses Script Savant where keyed. Opening pinned to IA wall clock / English burned-in: Hermana Viridiana 2:00; letter ~122.2–125s; vows line from 2:05 (125s); Está bien, Madre from 2:11 (131s). Tail shifted to preserve inter-cue gaps from cue 6 onward. Run: node scripts/fix-viridiana-opening-anchors.mjs; OCR sync skips first 5 cues (see sync-burned-in-ocr.mjs).",
  "cues": [
    {
      "start": 120,
      "end": 121.02,
      "words": [
        {
          "t": "Hermana Viridiana.",
          "en": "Sister Viridiana."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 121.06,
      "end": 122.12,
      "words": [
        {
          "t": "¿Madre?",
          "en": "Mother?"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 122.2,
      "end": 124.98,
      "words": [
        {
          "t": "Acabo de recibir una carta de tu tío.",
          "en": "I’ve just had a letter from your uncle."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 125,
      "end": 130.95,
      "words": [
        {
          "t": "No puede venir a la profesión.",
          "en": "He won’t be able to come when you take your vows."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 131,
      "end": 132.12,
      "words": [
        {
          "t": "Está bien, Madre.",
          "en": "All right, Mother."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 132.86,
      "end": 134.86,
      "words": [
        {
          "t": "No parece importarte mucho.",
          "en": "You don’t seem to mind very much."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 135.65,
      "end": 138.87,
      "words": [
        {
          "t": "Casi no le conozco, sólo le vi una vez, hace años, ya ni me acuerdo, pues ahora le invita a su casa.",
          "en": "I hardly know him. I saw him only once, some years ago. I can’t even remember him. Now he’s inviting you to his house."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 141.86,
      "end": 143.86,
      "words": [
        {
          "t": "Preferiría no salir del convento, Madre.",
          "en": "I’d prefer not to leave the convent, Mother."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 143.88,
      "end": 144.28,
      "words": [
        {
          "t": "Me temo que no se encuentre bien.",
          "en": "I’m afraid his health is not good."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 147.39,
      "end": 148.67,
      "words": [
        {
          "t": "Es tu único familiar y debes despedirte de él antes de profesar.",
          "en": "He’s your only relative and you ought to say farewell to him before taking your vows."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 150.57,
      "end": 151.21,
      "words": [
        {
          "t": "Seguramente no volverás a verle.",
          "en": "You will certainly never see him again."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 152.86,
      "end": 154.36,
      "words": [
        {
          "t": "¿Por qué quiere que vaya?",
          "en": "But why does he want to see me?"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 154.36,
      "end": 155.86,
      "words": [
        {
          "t": "Nunca se ha preocupado por mí.",
          "en": "He has never bothered about me."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 156.42,
      "end": 159.32,
      "words": [
        {
          "t": "Ha pagado sus estudios, la ha sostenido y acaba de enviar su dote.",
          "en": "He has paid for your studies and your maintenance, and he has just sent your dowry."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 159.37,
      "end": 162.62,
      "words": [
        {
          "t": "¿Qué más quiere?",
          "en": "Does that mean so little to you, Viridiana?"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 163.86,
      "end": 167.86,
      "words": [
        {
          "t": "Mi deseo sería no volver a ver el mundo, pero si su reverencia me lo ordena.",
          "en": "I have no desire to see the world again, but if you order me to…"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 168.86,
      "end": 170.86,
      "words": [
        {
          "t": "El retiro empezará pronto.",
          "en": "It's too late for him to start the retreat."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 171.66,
      "end": 172.06,
      "words": [
        {
          "t": "Así que puedes marcharte mañana por la mañana.",
          "en": "So he can go tomorrow itself."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 174.13,
      "end": 175.09,
      "words": [
        {
          "t": "En su celda encontrará todo lo necesario para el viaje.",
          "en": "Everything you need for the journey has been put in your cell."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 179.48,
      "end": 179.88,
      "words": [
        {
          "t": "Procure ser afectuosa con él.",
          "en": "Go get yourself ready, and try to show him some affection."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 209.86,
      "end": 211.86,
      "words": [
        {
          "t": "Ya está bien por hoy, Rita.",
          "en": "That’s enough for today, Rita."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 213.18,
      "end": 213.58,
      "words": [
        {
          "t": "Te gusta la cuerda que te he regalado.",
          "en": "Do you like that rope I gave you?"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 214.38,
      "end": 215.02,
      "words": [
        {
          "t": "Se salta mejor porque tiene mangos.",
          "en": "It’s easier to jump with: it’s got handles."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 215.86,
      "end": 217.86,
      "words": [
        {
          "t": "Anda, vete a jugar.",
          "en": "Go away now. Go and play."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 228.86,
      "end": 230.86,
      "words": [
        {
          "t": "Déjelo, señorita.",
          "en": "Hello."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 230.86,
      "end": 231.86,
      "words": [
        {
          "t": "Buenos días.",
          "en": "Hello."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 231.86,
      "end": 232.86,
      "words": [
        {
          "t": "Hola.",
          "en": "Hello."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 234.44,
      "end": 234.84,
      "words": [
        {
          "t": "Bienvenida, señorita.",
          "en": "Welcome, miss."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 236.42,
      "end": 237.06,
      "words": [
        {
          "t": "Soy Ramona, la criada de Don Jaime.",
          "en": "I’m Ramona, Don Jaime’s servant."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 237.86,
      "end": 238.86,
      "words": [
        {
          "t": "Ah, mucho gusto.",
          "en": "Ah! Pleased to meet you."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 238.86,
      "end": 239.86,
      "words": [
        {
          "t": "Viridiana.",
          "en": "Viridiana!"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 240.13,
      "end": 243.35,
      "words": [
        {
          "t": "",
          "en": "How are you?"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 246.49,
      "end": 246.89,
      "words": [
        {
          "t": "¿Cómo está, tío?",
          "en": "Yes, Uncle. How are you?"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 246.94,
      "end": 247.86,
      "words": [
        {
          "t": "Bien, bien.",
          "en": "I’m well …"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 249.44,
      "end": 249.84,
      "words": [
        {
          "t": "Llegó el autocar tarde, ¿verdad?",
          "en": "The bus was late, wasn’t it?"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 249.86,
      "end": 250.86,
      "words": [
        {
          "t": "¿Qué tal el viaje?",
          "en": "What was the journey like?"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 250.86,
      "end": 251.86,
      "words": [
        {
          "t": "Muy bueno.",
          "en": "Excellent."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 251.91,
      "end": 253.08,
      "words": [
        {
          "t": "Qué lugar tan apacible, tío.",
          "en": "What a charming, peaceful place, Uncle."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 254.14,
      "end": 254.54,
      "words": [
        {
          "t": "Muy tranquilo.",
          "en": "Very quiet."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 254.86,
      "end": 256.86,
      "words": [
        {
          "t": "Creerá que aún estás en el convento.",
          "en": "You’ll think you’re still at the convent."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 257.25,
      "end": 259.19,
      "words": [
        {
          "t": "¿Cuánto tiempo te vas a quedar?",
          "en": "How long are you staying?"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 259.86,
      "end": 261.86,
      "words": [
        {
          "t": "Muy poco, tío.",
          "en": "A very short while, Uncle."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 261.86,
      "end": 263.86,
      "words": [
        {
          "t": "Solo tengo permiso para unos días.",
          "en": "I’ve been given permission to stay only a few days."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 263.86,
      "end": 265.86,
      "words": [
        {
          "t": "¿Te costó mucho conseguirlo.",
          "en": "Did you spend a lot of time getting it?"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 265.86,
      "end": 267.36,
      "words": [
        {
          "t": "No.",
          "en": "No."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 267.36,
      "end": 268.86,
      "words": [
        {
          "t": "Vine por orden de la superiora.",
          "en": "No. Mother Superior told me to come."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 269.4,
      "end": 269.8,
      "words": [
        {
          "t": "Tampoco te interesaba verme",
          "en": "I came for orders from the superior."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 270.86,
      "end": 272.86,
      "words": [
        {
          "t": "que te lo tuvieron que ordenar.",
          "en": "I was not interested in seeing what you had to order."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 275.22,
      "end": 275.62,
      "words": [
        {
          "t": "La verdad, no mucho.",
          "en": "To tell you the truth, not very much."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 277.44,
      "end": 277.84,
      "words": [
        {
          "t": "Yo no se mentir, tío.",
          "en": "I cannot lie."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 278.14,
      "end": 278.54,
      "words": [
        {
          "t": "Le tengo respeto y agradecimiento",
          "en": "I respect and thank you for the matter."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 279.86,
      "end": 281.86,
      "words": [
        {
          "t": "porque en lo material se lo debo todo.",
          "en": "I owe it to you."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 281.86,
      "end": 282.86,
      "words": [
        {
          "t": "Pero en lo demás...",
          "en": "You have no feelings toward …"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 282.86,
      "end": 284.86,
      "words": [
        {
          "t": "Ningún cariño humano.",
          "en": "You have no feelings toward …"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 284.86,
      "end": 285.86,
      "words": [
        {
          "t": "Ninguno.",
          "en": "No."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 285.86,
      "end": 286.86,
      "words": [
        {
          "t": "Tiene razón.",
          "en": "You are right."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 288.18,
      "end": 288.58,
      "words": [
        {
          "t": "La soledad me ha vuelto egoísta.",
          "en": "Being alone has made me self-centered."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 288.86,
      "end": 291.86,
      "words": [
        {
          "t": "Ahora siento que no hayamos tenido más trato.",
          "en": "Now I am sorry we have not seen more of each other."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 291.86,
      "end": 293.86,
      "words": [
        {
          "t": "Demasiado tarde, ¿verdad?",
          "en": "It’s too late, isn’t it?"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 293.86,
      "end": 294.86,
      "words": [
        {
          "t": "Sí.",
          "en": "Yes."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 294.86,
      "end": 296.86,
      "words": [
        {
          "t": "Demasiado tarde.",
          "en": "It’s too late."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 296.86,
      "end": 299.86,
      "words": [
        {
          "t": "Tienes muy abandonados los campos, tío.",
          "en": "Too late."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 300.4,
      "end": 300.8,
      "words": [
        {
          "t": "Desde hace 20 años,",
          "en": "You're not very abandoned in the fields, ma'am."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 300.86,
      "end": 302.86,
      "words": [
        {
          "t": "las hierbas se han hecho dueñas de todo.",
          "en": "It's been 20 years since you've done all this."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 302.86,
      "end": 305.86,
      "words": [
        {
          "t": "Y en la casa, aparte del primer piso,",
          "en": "There are spiders all over the house except on the first floor."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 306.4,
      "end": 306.8,
      "words": [
        {
          "t": "se reproducen muy bien las arañas.",
          "en": "There are spiders all over the house except on the first floor."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 307.86,
      "end": 309.86,
      "words": [
        {
          "t": "Apenas salgo al campo.",
          "en": "I hardly ever go out."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 311.7,
      "end": 312.1,
      "words": [
        {
          "t": "Es verdad.",
          "en": "It’s true."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 312.15,
      "end": 313.86,
      "words": [
        {
          "t": "Y cuando sale, me hace saltar a la comba.",
          "en": "When he goes out he makes me jump rope."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 314.87,
      "end": 315.83,
      "words": [
        {
          "t": "Ven aquí, perrito.",
          "en": "Come down here, you scamp."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 315.86,
      "end": 316.86,
      "words": [
        {
          "t": "¿Quién es?",
          "en": "Who is she?"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 316.86,
      "end": 318.86,
      "words": [
        {
          "t": "Es la hija de Ramona, mi sirvienta.",
          "en": "My maid Ramona’s daughter."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 318.86,
      "end": 319.5,
      "words": [
        {
          "t": "¡Venga!",
          "en": "Come down."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 320.14,
      "end": 320.54,
      "words": [
        {
          "t": "Está hecha una salvaje.",
          "en": "She’s a little animal."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 322.92,
      "end": 323.32,
      "words": [
        {
          "t": "¿Cómo te parece esa tu tía?",
          "en": "How like your aunt you are, even in your walk."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 324.86,
      "end": 326.86,
      "words": [
        {
          "t": "Hasta el mismo modo de andar.",
          "en": "How like your aunt you are, even in your walk."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 326.86,
      "end": 328.86,
      "words": [
        {
          "t": "Ya lo sé, tío.",
          "en": "I know, Uncle, you’ve told me that already."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 328.86,
      "end": 329.86,
      "words": [
        {
          "t": "Ya me lo ha dicho usted antes.",
          "en": "I know, Uncle, you’ve told me that already."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 329.86,
      "end": 331.86,
      "words": [
        {
          "t": "Hasta en la voz también.",
          "en": "You see it, and your voice too."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 379.86,
      "end": 381.86,
      "words": [
        {
          "t": "¿Qué pasa?",
          "en": "Come on."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
